{"4398760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DIVEBOMB", "steam_appid": 4398760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What goes down must launch back up. Master momentum in DIVEBOMB, a chaotic platformer where falling is your fuel. Precision-dive through lethal gauntlets, defy gravity, and stay airborne at any cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIVEBOMB is a high-stakes platforming gauntlet where the only way to win is to (literally) take leaps of faith. DIVE through the sky, hijack planes, and BOMB to launch yourself through the sky!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person action-packed parkour gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, hand-crafted gauntlet-style levels. Master each stage to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven planes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ bosses that put your skill to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different abilities to earn that adapt to your play-style</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farther you fall, the higher you can reach. Take huge leaps of faith, and launch yourself into the sky to gain more points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398760/extras/89eb149149302d9fce0b12acd11ea804.poster.avif?t=1771005943\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398760/extras/89eb149149302d9fce0b12acd11ea804.webm?t=1771005943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398760/extras/89eb149149302d9fce0b12acd11ea804.mp4?t=1771005943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOMB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your head! Keep track of how much charge you have stored up, aim, and cross your fingers on each launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398760/extras/b6d9a8ed4121e47f3847e5a59ff1d99a.poster.avif?t=1771005943\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398760/extras/b6d9a8ed4121e47f3847e5a59ff1d99a.webm?t=1771005943\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398760/extras/b6d9a8ed4121e47f3847e5a59ff1d99a.mp4?t=1771005943\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What goes down must launch back up. Master momentum in DIVEBOMB, a chaotic platformer where falling is your fuel. Precision-dive through lethal gauntlets, defy gravity, and stay airborne at any cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DIVEBOMB is a high-stakes platforming gauntlet where the only way to win is to (literally) take leaps of faith. DIVE through the sky, hijack planes, and BOMB to launch yourself through the sky!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person action-packed parkour gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, hand-crafted gauntlet-style levels. Master each stage to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven planes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ bosses that put your skill to the test</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different abilities to earn that adapt to your play-style</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farther you fall, the higher you can reach. Take huge leaps of faith, and launch yourself into the sky to gain more points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i